      "url": "https://x.com/realHazeezat/status/2117288633400979558",
      "text": "Please how can I send an email to \n@Officialspeedaf who have their email address? I need to explain to them that their riders would stay somewhere and start messaging you to come to so so place to receive your packages, one even threatened me. Do I have to write to Temu too? Cos why I’m buying from Temu is cos it’s doorstep delivery and this has been going on for a while. I can’t be told something is doorstep delivery and riders should be threatening me to leave my business to come and collect.",
